(DocChat AI Architecture Overview - Page 1) '
(DocChat AI is an enterprise-grade document intelligence platform powered by Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\). In Phase 2, the system establishes a robust Document Ingestion Pipeline designed to parse diverse document formats, decompose them into semantically cohesive passages, compute high-dimensional vector representations, and index them into a persistent vector database.) '
(The DocumentLoader service is responsible for ingesting files from in-memory byte buffers or the local filesystem. For Portable Document Format \(PDF\) files, the loader uses pypdf to parse the binary object graph, inspect page dictionaries, and extract clean text streams while meticulously preserving the source page numbers. This page preservation ensures that subsequent citation modules in Phase 3 can provide exact page-level source references for every assertion made by the language model.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
